{# Body of the java-agents block in the Minion sysconfig file: one EXTRA_JAVA_OPTS
   line holding every enabled agent. systemd parses this file as an
   EnvironmentFile and keeps only the last assignment of a key, with no
   $VAR expansion, so a second block setting EXTRA_JAVA_OPTS would silently
   unload the first agent.

   Single-quoted for the reason pyroscope-env.j2 gives: the file is also sourced
   as shell. The paths come from this role's vars and carry no single quote. #}
EXTRA_JAVA_OPTS='{{ _opennms_minion_java_agents | join(' ') }}'
